    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Anum Shiraz and Sehrish Parwaiz, from the School of Nursing and Midwifery's General Nursing Diploma programme, secured the first and third positions respectively in the recently concluded examinations conducted by the Sindh Nurses Examination Board, Karachi.",
